<title>SLOVENIA: SOCCER-SLOVENIA 0 BOSNIA 2 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SLOVENIA 0 BOSNIA 2 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bosnia led Slovenia 2-0 in their World Cup European group one qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Elvir Bolic 5, Meho Kodro 32</p>
